WEBVTT

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:34.120
Hold the phone! What in the
world is going on here?!

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:38.970
Takao Kinomiya, who was thought to be going pro, has just declared a challenge!

00:01:38.970 --> 00:01:45.180
A match between the world champ
and fiercely powerful pros is on!

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:56.280
Chairman Volkov!
A word on today's events?

00:01:56.600 --> 00:02:01.130
Will Kinomiya's opponent
be Garland, after all?

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:05.310
We're in the midst of
carefully selecting our players.

00:02:05.310 --> 00:02:08.380
Because our opponent
is the Takao Kinomiya.

00:02:09.330 --> 00:02:13.500
That being said, BEGA has its
fair share of excellent Bladers.

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:17.600
This is a rare opportunity,
so I'd like to propose

00:02:17.600 --> 00:02:22.720
a five-on-five team match with
Mr. Kinomiya and a handpicked BEGA team.

00:02:23.150 --> 00:02:24.300
A five-on-five?

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:25.940
This is amazing news!

00:02:25.940 --> 00:02:28.510
But as for
Kinomiya's team...

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:31.440
We wouldn't do
it now, of course.

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:34.220
The match will be
one month from now.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:39.840
I would like for Mr. Kinomiya to
assemble members for his team until then.

00:02:40.150 --> 00:02:44.250
Well, this is quite the
unexpected turn of events!

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:47.600
Do you have doubts that
Kinomiya will accept this challenge?

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.680
I wouldn't call it a "challenge".

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:55.690
All I would like is to use this opportunity to show the talent of BEGA's players.

00:02:55.690 --> 00:02:59.660
That being said,
we plan to win, above all.

00:03:00.130 --> 00:03:07.630
Mr. Kinomiya, let's have a heated battle
between Bladers, fair and square.

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:12.090
Damn you, Volkov!
A five-on-five team battle?!

00:03:12.090 --> 00:03:14.310
He's definitely confident.

00:03:14.310 --> 00:03:17.790
BEGA has players
like Garland and Moses.

00:03:17.790 --> 00:03:19.960
And Mystel, I assume.

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:21.530
And Ming-Ming...

00:03:21.530 --> 00:03:22.880
Perfect!

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:26.510
If I can crush BEGA, I'll accept
whatever conditions he puts out!

00:03:28.250 --> 00:03:29.880
Because we've got...

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:31.050
Max!

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:32.400
And Rei!

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.680
We won't lose to anyone!

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.830
Aren't you forgetting someone?!

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:41.340
Adding in Takao...

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:43.250
That's four.

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:47.130
We've have an even
greater team if Kai was with us...

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:48.880
Kai...

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.740
Hiromi! Shh!

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:55.380
Kai...
Why did he have to...

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:58.440
How could you
join with Volkov?

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:04.880
If Kai gets chosen
to represent BEGA...

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:07.760
I might have to
fight Kai again...?

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.090
It's just like...

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:11.330
The world championships
all over again, right?

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:17.000
On top of that, I kind of
understand how he feels.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:17.880
Rei...

00:04:17.880 --> 00:04:21.380
But now's not
the time to say that!

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:25.780
We've got to do our best with
the members we have here!

00:04:25.780 --> 00:04:28.930
Even with the
members we have here...

00:04:33.570 --> 00:04:34.970
Absolutely not!

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:37.580
Not against an opponent
even Yuriy couldn't beat!

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.170
I couldn't possibly...

00:04:39.810 --> 00:04:42.220
What about Yuriy, then?

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:46.240
He got hurt quite badly
back then, so who knows...

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:49.600
We've got a month
until the match, right?

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:53.440
If we need a fifth
member, it's gotta be Yuriy!

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:56.000
I'm sure he'll
be better by then!

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.090
The glass is
half-full for you, huh...

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:03.920
I think Daichi's on
the right track.

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:09.540
I think it's better to say we still have
a month left, rather than only a month left!

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:10.480
Yeah!

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:14.910
Alright! In any case,
we just have to train!

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:19.950
Right on!
That's the Takao I know!

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:22.600
Let's save the moping for
later and do our best!

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:23.940
--Yeah!

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.150
Takao!

00:05:27.990 --> 00:05:31.960
Here you are!
You've got company!

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:33.260
Company?

00:05:33.680 --> 00:05:36.980
And they're a little weird...

00:05:40.750 --> 00:05:44.570
Oh, you mean the sponsors?

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.360
Oh, Mr. Kinomiya!

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.450
Is it true?

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:50.240
Is what true?

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.360
That you aren't joining BEGA?

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:57.940
And that you're going against
BEGA in a five-on-five match?

00:05:57.940 --> 00:06:00.410
Yeah. Got a
problem with that?

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:02.450
No, but...

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:08.170
Our contracts were based on the assumption that you would be

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:11.020
participating in the BEGA
League as professionals.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:15.060
If you're going to have a match with BEGA, let's forget these talks ever...

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.920
Oh, come on!

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:21.600
We have our
reasons, of course...

00:06:21.600 --> 00:06:23.580
Please don't take it personally.

00:06:23.580 --> 00:06:24.550
We will!

00:06:24.550 --> 00:06:28.540
It doesn't matter where we join!
We're still us, right?

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:31.180
Don't be so freakin' selfish!

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.520
In any case...

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:35.420
Goodbye!

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:40.510
What's their problem?
It's like they did a total 180...

00:06:41.060 --> 00:06:44.960
Ta-da! I've got a wonderful
announcement for you all today!

00:06:44.960 --> 00:06:52.400
BEGA's Blader ID Program will begin soon! It'll be sure to stir up a storm in the world of Beyblade!

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:58.880
With a BEGA ID card, you'll be able to receive parts and maintenance!

00:06:58.880 --> 00:07:04.340
If you want new Beys or parts,
you'll need one of these ID cards soon!

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:05.900
So sign up soon, 'kay?

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.460
And on top of that!

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.950
Registered Bladers will have their
records linked to their IDs,

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:13.580
and automatically
transferred to BEGA HQ!

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:19.720
This way, we can check on talented
Bladers from all over the country!

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:22.800
If you haven't registered yet,

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:27.740
don't delay, hurry to your
nearest Beyblade shop!

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:30.320
ID registration?

00:07:30.320 --> 00:07:32.720
So it has finally begun, has it?

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:37.800
Volkov aims to get all
of Japan's Bladers on his side.

00:07:37.800 --> 00:07:42.240
Not like this ID system has
anything to do with us, anyway.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:45.740
No, this isn't the last
we should expect of it.

00:07:48.260 --> 00:07:53.060
It's nice to support
Bladers with IDs, but...

00:07:53.060 --> 00:07:59.920
It's likely that without registered IDs,
you won't even be able to get new Beys.

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:01.340
No...!

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:05.460
Blasted Volkov!
"Fair and square" my foot!

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:08.680
Is he gonna lock us out
of Beyblading entirely?

00:08:09.720 --> 00:08:11.240
I'm going!

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.820
Going where?

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:14.320
To Beyblade shops!

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:18.880
There might be a place that
hasn't started taking IDs yet!

00:08:20.200 --> 00:08:23.680
Time for your capable
manager to strut her stuff!

00:08:23.680 --> 00:08:26.480
Stay calm and wait right here!

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:31.040
Not bad for an old hag...

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.980
Did you say something?

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:35.880
Nope! Nothin'...

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:39.660
Really? Okay, I'm off then!

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:46.330
We've got even
more big news!

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:51.620
Here, we have a
press release at BEGA HQ.

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:55.280
We have reports that today, a
special coach will be introduced

00:08:55.280 --> 00:09:01.150
who has been brought on board
for the match with Kinomiya.

00:09:01.680 --> 00:09:03.610
A special coach?

00:09:03.610 --> 00:09:06.220
If they're going out of their
way to introduce them here...

00:09:06.220 --> 00:09:07.880
Who could it be?

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:21.620
No way! It couldn't be!

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:27.440
Jin of the Gale...!

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.960
What an unexpected appearance!

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:34.620
--T-That's our coach!

00:09:35.050 --> 00:09:38.340
That's him all right...
Why would Mr. Kinomiya...

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:41.880
Hitoshi...

00:09:42.450 --> 00:09:45.460
That's impossible!

00:09:52.170 --> 00:10:00.000
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:04.000
Damn!

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:06.380
Dammit... Why?!

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:08.100
And now my brother too?!

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:11.220
Damn! Damn! Damn!

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:20.640
He's who showed me how fun
Beyblade in the first place!

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:27.100
I worked hard to be recognized by
my brother as a strong Blader!

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.100
And now--damn!!

00:10:31.780 --> 00:10:33.320
Cool it, Takao.

00:10:33.840 --> 00:10:35.110
Rei...

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:40.440
Stop. You should use
that hand to defeat BEGA.

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:43.090
Shut up! I know that!

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:46.080
But my brother and Kai are...

00:10:47.060 --> 00:10:50.120
You wouldn't know how I feel.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:54.420
Then how about this, Takao?
Would you know how I feel?

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:59.720
You don't understand
how I feel at all!

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:01.180
Rei...

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.450
I want you to
remember one thing, Takao.

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:10.220
To Kai, Max, and myself,
you're our greatest rival!

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:13.560
We want to fight you,
even stronger than before!

00:11:13.560 --> 00:11:15.730
To truly clash with you!

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:20.920
That's why Kai chose
BEGA! To fight you!

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:25.760
I imagine that Jin of the Gale
went to their side to see you grow.

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:31.040
Even as a coach,
it was all to fight you, Takao!

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:33.540
My brother did that, for me...

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:36.700
You too, Rei?

00:11:36.700 --> 00:11:39.520
I have no intention
of joining BEGA, but...

00:11:39.520 --> 00:11:42.050
Should I go
with you or not?

00:11:42.320 --> 00:11:45.610
I have reservations about doing that, so it's stirring doubts.

00:11:46.410 --> 00:11:47.380
Which is why...

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.360
I challenge you, Takao!

00:11:50.360 --> 00:11:52.780
Battle me!
Right here, right now!

00:11:52.780 --> 00:11:55.150
Reservations? Doubts?

00:11:56.840 --> 00:11:58.580
You're on, Rei!

00:11:58.580 --> 00:12:02.340
If you wanna battle that
badly, I'll take you on!

00:12:04.330 --> 00:12:06.700
Go, Dragoon!

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:09.140
Driger!!

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:18.900
Here they are!

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:20.760
Hey, look at that!

00:12:21.460 --> 00:12:24.100
Why now, of all times?!

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.980
I'm not holding back, Rei!

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:43.460
Not yet!

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.500
Too easy!

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:54.440
I can't lose now!

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:57.120
It doesn't matter who I'm
against. Not until I beat BEGA...

00:12:57.120 --> 00:12:59.400
I will not lose!

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:03.300
Then prove it.

00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:06.740
I'm not going to lie
down and let you beat me!

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:16.120
Takao! Rei! What's wrong?!

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:19.880
Wow!
They're going at it for real!

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:21.860
This is no joke!

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:26.300
There's no guarantee their Beys will make it out in one piece if they battle for real!

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.640
Please, stop!

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:32.900
We don't know if we'll
be able to get new Beys!

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.100
Let's go, Dragoon!

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:41.800
We won't lose! Driger!

00:13:43.540 --> 00:13:45.780
Sorry, even if you say that...

00:13:45.780 --> 00:13:47.240
Are you sure you can't?

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:49.340
I can't, sorry.

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:53.760
I can't give a single part to
anyone who doesn't have an ID.

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:56.720
Don't say that.
There's got to be a way...

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:58.660
Sorry.

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:02.620
If you want one that badly,
you should just register an ID.

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:05.220
I wouldn't be
complaining if I could.

00:14:05.220 --> 00:14:08.120
Gimme the new
Attack Ring, mister!

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:09.680
Here!

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:13.560
Yes sir, coming right up!

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:19.000
We're just getting started!
You can do it, Hiromi!

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:28.580
What in
the world is that...?

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:38.200
Well?
Done for already, Takao?

00:14:38.200 --> 00:14:40.380
As if!

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.140
What?!

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:05.820
Get up, Takao!
I know you're not that weak!

00:15:22.280 --> 00:15:24.460
Rei, you're as good as ever.

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:28.180
Where're your doubts now?

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:29.480
This is it!

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:33.760
This is the Takao Kinomiya
I wanted to face!

00:15:35.660 --> 00:15:35.920
That's right. I get it, Rei.
This is what you...

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:41.020
--Whoa! So cool! Go get 'em! Don't lose!

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:43.560
Superb. This is it!

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:47.960
This is the kind of battle I've wanted to see, that I've put so much effort towards!

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:55.040
For passionate Beybladers like Takao and Rei, who love Beyblade with all their hearts.

00:15:56.580 --> 00:15:58.320
Time to go.

00:15:58.320 --> 00:16:00.870
Yeah. My pleasure.

00:16:02.260 --> 00:16:06.680
Takao! Show me what
you're like at 100%!

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:12.330
Giving 100% is too stingy.

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:17.130
Here's Takao Kinomiya at 1,000%!

00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:26.660
What is this...?

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:39.040
Gatling Claw Maximum!!

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:45.520
Galaxy Turbo Twister!!

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:48.620
Can they take this?!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:52.760
How?!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.420
I'm beat!

00:17:26.880 --> 00:17:27.940
Takao!

00:17:27.940 --> 00:17:29.020
Rei!

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:31.620
Are the two of you okay?

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:33.900
You're something else, Takao.

00:17:34.260 --> 00:17:37.300
I'm glad I was able
to fight against you.

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:39.140
Same here, Rei.

00:17:39.140 --> 00:17:42.420
You're one of
my best rivals.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:45.140
You should be
satisfied now, Rei.

00:17:46.000 --> 00:17:47.340
Max!

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:50.120
I know how Rei feels.

00:17:50.120 --> 00:17:55.320
Rei was the only one who didn't have a real
battle against you in the world championships.

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:58.870
That frustration built up,
and it wouldn't be healthy

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:00.940
for the team even if he
teamed up with you.

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:02.320
That's why.

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:03.440
Rei...

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:06.500
Right! Back then...

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:14.840
But that was a
real 100% Takao.

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:17.520
No, even higher than that.

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:20.000
My doubts have been cleared.

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:24.820
I look forward to working
together again, Takao.

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:26.730
Me too.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:31.720
I need your strength, Rei.

00:18:31.720 --> 00:18:33.040
That, and...

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:37.320
I've had my
doubts cleared, too.

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:41.170
About a lot of stuff,
like Kai and my brother.

00:18:41.170 --> 00:18:44.800
But that's all been cleared
out with my battle with you.

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:50.130
My mind blanked out, and I was
able to just focus on my battle.

00:18:50.130 --> 00:18:53.060
That's what a Beybattle's gotta be!

00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:58.920
If you get hung up on all the details, then it's just like how you were in the world championships!

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:01.400
Listen, you!

00:19:02.980 --> 00:19:05.700
But believe me, Rei.

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:09.420
We all have times when we get
mad, depressed, or act lame.

00:19:09.420 --> 00:19:12.850
Even so, I'm at
100% all the time!

00:19:13.940 --> 00:19:14.900
That's right!

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:19.740
Even when you're down,
you're always at 100%, Takao!

00:19:19.740 --> 00:19:21.260
Right.

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:27.360
I knew it!

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:30.840
What's the matter?

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:33.520
This is awful!

00:19:33.520 --> 00:19:36.080
Awful doesn't even
begin to describe it!

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:39.050
You won't be able to use these Beys like they are now!

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:40.800
That bad?

00:19:40.800 --> 00:19:42.560
We don't have any spares,

00:19:42.560 --> 00:19:46.780
so all we can do is count on Hiromi,
who went to the Beyblade shops...

00:19:46.780 --> 00:19:48.660
Hey, guys!

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:50.280
I'm back...

00:19:50.650 --> 00:19:51.820
Hiromi!

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:54.020
Where'd this hole come from?

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:56.180
No good.

00:19:56.180 --> 00:19:58.510
It was ID this-and-that
everywhere I went.

00:19:58.510 --> 00:19:59.960
What a pain!

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.370
Is that so...

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:04.880
We were just getting
on a good note, too...

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:07.760
We don't even have something
as basic as Beys, we're done for.

00:20:07.940 --> 00:20:11.040
How could we even
fight BEGA with these?

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:13.570
If we don't have any,
we should just make our own!

00:20:16.010 --> 00:20:19.760
Just make 'em!
Isn't it obvious?

00:20:19.760 --> 00:20:20.780
Make our own...

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.300
Make our own, huh?

00:20:25.760 --> 00:20:28.620
He's right. We just
gotta make our own!

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:31.500
We aren't BEGA Bladers.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:34.810
We don't have to use
the same Beys that they do.

00:20:35.800 --> 00:20:39.000
We each have our
own fighting styles.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:41.220
So we should have
our own Beys!

00:20:41.460 --> 00:20:44.530
Our own Beys...

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:48.000
It's my time to shine, then!

00:20:48.000 --> 00:20:51.160
All this data I've been collecting by habit should come in handy!

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:53.560
Please, leave this to me!

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:54.900
Thanks, Kyoujyu.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:56.700
We're counting on you.

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:59.190
I'll help in whatever way I can!

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:03.340
As long as you don't
touch my laptop, Hiromi...

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.240
--What's that supposed to mean?!

00:21:06.240 --> 00:21:06.960
The time has come to leave it to them.

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:14.080
The future of Beyblading belongs to you all, who love Beyblade so much.

00:21:14.920 --> 00:21:20.920
We need to find the fifth member,
and make our own Beys!

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:22.900
Wow! We'll be busy!

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:23.960
Yup.

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:26.680
But with this team,
we'll be fine.

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:29.640
Let's get through this
with our fiery Beyspirits!

00:22:55.840 --> 00:22:58.860
Come with me, Brooklyn!
Time for practical drills.

00:22:58.860 --> 00:23:01.760
See with your eyes,
and remember with your body!

00:23:02.530 --> 00:23:06.610
That coach is something else, for being able to get Brooklyn to practice.

00:23:06.610 --> 00:23:09.610
But he's in a different
dimension than us.

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:13.000
Brooklyn is a true genius.
A Beyblading prodigy!

00:23:13.000 --> 00:23:16.580
If you're not careful,
you'll be sent to hell!

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:19.570
I look forward to working
with you, Coach Kinomiya.
